WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.423 --> 00:00:18.144
Bloom sat in his office at City Hall.

2
00:00:19.205 --> 00:00:19.965
His phone rang.

3
00:00:24.828 --> 00:00:26.669
time," said a voice on the phone.

4
00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:29.570
"Yes, boss," said Mayor Bloom.

5
00:00:31.251 --> 00:00:32.112
He hung up the phone.

6
00:00:38.668 --> 00:00:41.010
The mayor went into another room and opened a safe.

7
00:00:42.391 --> 00:00:43.712
He pulled out a bunch of money.

8
00:00:43.732 --> 00:00:47.394
"Mayor Bloom," said the mayor's assistant.

9
00:00:47.414 --> 00:00:49.536
"What are you doing?

10
00:00:50.396 --> 00:00:53.238
That's the money for the new playground in Metro City Park."

11
00:00:54.199 --> 00:00:55.600
Mayor Bloom didn't say anything.

12
00:00:56.461 --> 00:00:58.602
He stuffed the money into a briefcase and ran.

13
00:01:03.225 --> 00:01:06.608
hope the new playground has a really big fort," said Jack.

14
00:01:07.736 --> 00:01:10.397
"With bridges, ladders, slides, and tunnels!"

15
00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:13.558
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Park.

16
00:01:15.078 --> 00:01:17.399
They were standing in an open area filled with weeds.

17
00:01:18.659 --> 00:01:20.340
It was where the new playground would be soon.

18
00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:23.221
"I hope the playground has a tower!"

19
00:01:23.561 --> 00:01:24.141
said Terrell.

20
00:01:24.161 --> 00:01:27.282
"I want a swing set," said Roxy.

21
00:01:27.302 --> 00:01:30.783
"Swinging makes me feel like I can fly."

22
00:01:32.503 --> 00:01:34.204
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

23
00:01:35.656 --> 00:01:38.617
"I hope they build the playground soon," said Mara.

24
00:01:38.637 --> 00:01:41.259
"I'm tired of waiting for it."

25
00:01:41.279 --> 00:01:45.660
"We should get Rocket Girl to build the playground," said Terrell.

26
00:01:45.681 --> 00:01:48.662
"She could build it really fast."

27
00:01:50.202 --> 00:01:51.323
Roxy rolled her eyes.

28
00:01:51.343 --> 00:01:55.925
"I think Rocket Girl has more important things to do."

29
00:01:56.885 --> 00:01:57.766
Terrell sighed.

30
00:01:57.786 --> 00:02:00.067
"You're right," he said.

31
00:02:01.127 --> 00:02:02.348
Suddenly his eyes lit up.

32
00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.062
"You know what would be really cool?"

33
00:02:05.302 --> 00:02:05.842
he asked.

34
00:02:06.863 --> 00:02:08.144
"What?" asked Jack.

35
00:02:08.164 --> 00:02:11.487
"If there were two Rocket Girls!"

36
00:02:11.907 --> 00:02:12.588
said Terrell.

37
00:02:12.608 --> 00:02:17.832
"One could fight super villains, and the other could build our playground!"

38
00:02:19.414 --> 00:02:20.395
Everyone laughed.

39
00:02:22.677 --> 00:02:23.657
Roxy shook her head.

40
00:02:23.677 --> 00:02:29.102
"Terrell, that is the silliest thing I ever heard in my entire life."

41
00:02:30.203 --> 00:02:31.164
Terrell shrugged.

42
00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:34.781
"I'm just saying It would be cool."

43
00:02:36.201 --> 00:02:38.862
Just then Roxy's wristwatch beeped quietly.

44
00:02:40.602 --> 00:02:42.143
Roxy walked away from her friends.

45
00:02:47.844 --> 00:02:49.205
She pressed a button on her watch.

46
00:02:50.985 --> 00:02:52.886
Detective Smith's face appeared on the screen.

47
00:02:52.906 --> 00:02:56.907
"Uh-oh!" thought Roxy.

48
00:02:57.907 --> 00:03:00.048
"Detective Smith doesn't know who I really am!"

49
00:03:01.192 --> 00:03:02.774
Roxy quickly put on her mask.

50
00:03:02.794 --> 00:03:05.896
"Detective Smith," she whispered.

51
00:03:05.916 --> 00:03:07.678
"What's going on?

52
00:03:08.138 --> 00:03:09.219
Where's Mayor Bloom?"

53
00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.202
Detective Smith cleared his throat.

54
00:03:12.222 --> 00:03:14.824
"We have a problem, Rocket Girl.

55
00:03:16.045 --> 00:03:20.849
It looks like Mayor Bloom stole the money for the new playground at Metro City Park."

56
00:03:22.551 --> 00:03:23.491
Roxy was shocked.

57
00:03:23.511 --> 00:03:26.174
"No way," she said.

58
00:03:26.194 --> 00:03:28.596
"Mayor Bloom would never do that."

59
00:03:29.988 --> 00:03:32.652
"I know it's hard to believe," said Detective Smith.

60
00:03:32.672 --> 00:03:35.396
"But his assistant saw him do it.

61
00:03:36.317 --> 00:03:38.520
I need you to come down to City Hall right away."

62
00:03:39.501 --> 00:03:40.242
Roxy gulped.

63
00:03:40.262 --> 00:03:42.526
"Okay, Detective.

64
00:03:42.826 --> 00:03:43.807
I'll be right there."
